# ANN N1517 Retrospective 2

Recover the smallest target-blind successor that identifies the missing
estimator without changing the established coordinate, boundary, ownership, or
frozen dynamics.

## Historical Lineage `material`

The material records four historical residuals. A global active write exposed
cross-support contamination; passive proximity did not transport; one returned
value did not identify a unique owner; and N1516 left estimator identification
open while preserving the coordinate and frozen dynamics.

```Forma
exposes_contamination   :: GlobalActiveWrite `AR` CrossSupportContamination
leaves_local_ownership  :: CrossSupportContamination `AR` LocalOwnership
proximity_does_not_transport :: ActiveResidualProximity `AR` PassiveTransportFailure
leaves_commuting_receipt :: PassiveTransportFailure `AR` CommutingContinuation
one_return_is_ambiguous :: OneOwnedReturn `AR` OwnerAmbiguity
leaves_response_history :: OwnerAmbiguity `AR` ResponseHistory
ceiling_leaves_estimator :: ReachabilityCeiling `AR` MissingEstimator
ceiling_preserves_coordinate :: ReachabilityCeiling `AR` ExistingCoordinate
```

```Forma
boundary =
  MissingEstimator
  `P` ExistingCoordinate
  `P` TargetBlind
  `P` SameBoundary
  `P` OwnerTyped
  `P` LocalObservability
  `P` RankOwnedStopping
  `P` FrozenDynamics
  `P` IndependentContinuation

theory =
  UnresolvedDependenceOnly
  `P` FixedLeaderRemainder
```

The surviving mechanisms include boundary replay, owner probing, local
observation, rank closure, and frozen rollout. Target-future information,
durable model-state writes, and supplied history windows remain forbidden.

```Forma
required = boundary `P` theory

forbidden =
  TargetFuture
  `S` DurableWeightWrite
  `S` SuppliedHistoryWindow

successor ::
  BranchBudget `AR____`
  ResearchProjection `TR` (MechanismProduct `S` InseparableCore)

search_budget = BranchBudget 6 1
search_order = Lexicographic Mechanisms ExtraFacets PresentationOrder
successor = ?
```

The cited historical result is material evidence about ownership, transport,
and unresolved residuals; it does not select a playlist architecture.
